       ↓
Employee Resolver
       ↓
Leave Type
       ↓
Leave Policy
       ↓
Leave Year
       ↓
Holiday Calendar
       ↓
Work Week
       ↓
Requested Dates
       ↓
Overlap Validation
       ↓
Balance Validation
       ↓
Notice Period
       ↓
Approval Workflow
       ↓
Create Request
       ↓
Audit
       ↓
Notification
```

---

# 96. LEAVE APPROVAL PIPELINE

```text
Pending Request
       ↓
Resolve Approval Instance
       ↓
Validate Approver
       ↓
Validate Current Step
       ↓
Lock/Transaction
       ↓
Approve/Reject
       ↓
Update Workflow
       ↓
Update Leave Status
       ↓
Update Balance Ledger
       ↓
Update Attendance/Calendar
       ↓
Audit
       ↓
Notification
```

