The approval engine must be reusable.

Future:

```text
Leave
Regularization
Overtime
Comp-Off
Expense
Payroll
```

should be able to use the same workflow engine.

---

# 108. SEARCH & FILTERING

All major lists must support:

```text
Search
Pagination
Sorting
Filtering
Date range
Status
Department
Branch
Employee
```

Perform filtering server-side.

---

# 109. API PAGINATION

Never return unlimited:

```text
leave requests
approval requests
holiday records
regularization records
```

Use the existing pagination standard.

---

# 110. API ERROR HANDLING

Use stable error codes.

Examples:

```text
LEAVE_BALANCE_INSUFFICIENT
