REGULARIZATION_NOT_ALLOWED
HOLIDAY_CONFLICT
```

---

# 111. SECURITY

Protect against:

```text
IDOR
Cross-tenant access
Privilege escalation
Mass assignment
Self approval
Balance manipulation
Employee impersonation
Approval tampering
Workflow manipulation
```

The frontend must never be treated as a security boundary.

---

# 112. FILE SECURITY

If leave documents are supported:

```text
Validate
Scan where available
Store securely
Authorize downloads
Use signed URLs
Log access where appropriate
```

Do not expose public document URLs.

