```

Features should be tenant-aware where appropriate.

---

# 134. DEFAULT BEHAVIOR

Existing Phase 4 attendance should continue to work when Phase 6 features are not configured.

Example:

```text
No leave policy configured
        ↓
Attendance still works
```

Once leave management is configured:

```text
Leave approved
        ↓
Attendance recognizes leave
```

Do not make new features mandatory for existing tenants without migration/default configuration.

---

# 135. BUSINESS RULE SOURCE OF TRUTH

Clearly define:

```text
Employee → employee data
Attendance → attendance facts
Shift → work schedule
Holiday → holiday calendar
Leave → leave entitlement/request
Leave Ledger → balance changes
Approval → workflow decisions
```

Do not duplicate ownership of business facts unnecessarily.

---

